WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,800
Yao You, how do you know Jian Wuyan?

2
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:08,200
I'm sorry, Yao You, uncle scared you.

3
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:10,800
Uncle is just curious about how you met your new friend

4
00:00:10,800 --> 00:00:12,200
Can you tell me about it to your uncle?

5
00:00:12,200 --> 00:00:15,770
The two brothers are beautiful. He can also make small cakes.

6
00:00:15,770 --> 00:00:18,070
Xiangxiangdu

7
00:00:18,070 --> 00:00:20,870
Uncle, have a good meal. Goodbye.

8
00:00:20,870 --> 00:00:25,000
The horoscope of eating wild animals and the horoscope of being strong and healthy are exactly the same.

9
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:27,200
Since Youyou’s fate depends on Su Qianye

10
00:00:27,200 --> 00:00:30,180
Wouldn't that also mean that you are safe and sound?

11
00:00:30,180 --> 00:00:34,210
The troupe you are filming now is just a bunch of rabble-rousers

12
00:00:34,210 --> 00:00:37,990
This team is already an S-level configuration.

13
00:00:37,990 --> 00:00:40,390
It’s just that the problem of time bomb has not been solved yet

14
00:00:40,390 --> 00:00:46,900
My sister thinks I'm too poor

15
00:00:46,900 --> 00:00:50,100
Do I need to drive a Didi ride-hailing service to buy milk powder for her?

16
00:00:50,100 --> 00:00:52,700
Stupid, Youyou let you drive

17
00:00:52,700 --> 00:00:59,140
Grandma, we haven’t seen each other for a long time. I miss you so much.

18
00:00:59,140 --> 00:01:02,540
If you put honey on your little mouth, you will say something nice to coax me.

19
00:01:02,540 --> 00:01:05,740
I see you want to eat grandma’s cookies.

20
00:01:05,740 --> 00:01:09,790
I miss biscuits and grandma even more

21
00:01:09,790 --> 00:01:19,600
Take it and eat it, hahaha, you are Brother Youyou
